{"seq":3,"slug":"pigeonhole-inclusion-exclusion","title":"鸽巢原理与容斥原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/pigeonhole-inclusion-exclusion","wordCount":1867,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"鸽巢原理与容斥原理\">鸽巢原理与容斥原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>鸽巢原理和容斥原理是组合数学中两个强大的论证工具。鸽巢原理回答&quot;必然存在&quot;的问题——在某些条件下，碰撞或重叠是不可避免的。容斥原理回答&quot;精确计数&quot;的问题——当多个集合有交叉时，如何正确计算并集的大小。</p>\n<p>这两个原理在计算机科学中有广泛应用：鸽巢原理用于证明哈希碰撞的不可避免性、证明某些算法的下界；容斥原理用于精确计算满足&quot;至少一个条件&quot;的方案数、分析随机事件的概率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[组合论证工具]&#10;    A --&gt; B[鸽巢原理]&#10;    A --&gt; C[容斥原理]&#10;    B --&gt; D[存在性证明]&#10;    B --&gt; E[碰撞不可避免]&#10;    C --&gt; F[精确计数]&#10;    C --&gt; G[集合并的大小]&#10;    B --&gt; H[简单形式]&#10;    B --&gt; I[广义形式]&#10;    C --&gt; J[两集合]&#10;    C --&gt; K[多集合]\">graph TB\n    A[组合论证工具]\n    A --&gt; B[鸽巢原理]\n    A --&gt; C[容斥原理]\n    B --&gt; D[存在性证明]\n    B --&gt; E[碰撞不可避免]\n    C --&gt; F[精确计数]\n    C --&gt; G[集合并的大小]\n    B --&gt; H[简单形式]\n    B --&gt; I[广义形式]\n    C --&gt; J[两集合]\n    C --&gt; K[多集合]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n<th>编程对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>鸽巢原理</td>\n<td>n+1 个物体放入 n 个盒子 → 必有一个盒子有 ≥2 个</td>\n<td>哈希碰撞、循环检测</td>\n<td>碰撞检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广义鸽巢</td>\n<td>kn+1 个物体放入 n 个盒子 → 必有一个盒子有 ≥k+1 个</td>\n<td>负载均衡下界</td>\n<td>最坏情况分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容斥（两集合）</td>\n<td>|A∪B| = |A| + |B| - |A∩B|</td>\n<td>满足条件 A 或 B 的计数</td>\n<td>去重计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容斥（多集合）</td>\n<td>交替加减各级交集</td>\n<td>错排、满射计数</td>\n<td>概率计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"鸽巢原理\">鸽巢原理</h2><p><strong>鸽巢原理</strong>（Pigeonhole Principle）：如果 n+1 个物体放入 n 个盒子，则至少有一个盒子包含 2 个或更多物体。</p>\n<p>这个原理看似平凡，但其应用范围之广令人惊叹。它的力量在于：即使你不知道碰撞发生在哪里，也能确定碰撞<strong>必然存在</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>哈希碰撞</strong>：如果哈希函数将 m 个不同的键映射到 n 个桶（m &gt; n），则必有至少一个桶包含多个键。这是哈希表碰撞不可避免的数学根据。即使哈希函数再好，只要键的数量超过桶的数量，碰撞就一定发生。</p>\n<p><strong>循环检测</strong>（Floyd 判圈算法）：如果一个函数 f: S → S 从有限集合 S 映射到自身，那么从任意初始值出发的迭代序列 x, f(x), f(f(x)), ... 必然进入循环。因为 S 是有限的，经过 |S|+1 步后必有两个状态相同（鸽巢原理），之后就开始重复。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function findCycle&lt;T&gt;(start: T, next: (x: T) =&gt; T): { cycleStart: T; cycleLength: number } {&#10;  let slow = start;&#10;  let fast = start;&#10;&#10;  do {&#10;    slow = next(slow);&#10;    fast = next(next(fast));&#10;  } while (slow !== fast);&#10;&#10;  let cycleStart = start;&#10;  while (cycleStart !== slow) {&#10;    cycleStart = next(cycleStart);&#10;    slow = next(slow);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let cycleLength = 1;&#10;  let current = next(cycleStart);&#10;  while (current !== cycleStart) {&#10;    current = next(current);&#10;    cycleLength++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return { cycleStart, cycleLength };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findCycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cycleStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cycleLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  do</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(slow);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fast));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cycleStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cycleStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cycleStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cycleStart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(slow);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cycleLength </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cycleStart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cycleStart) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cycleLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { cycleStart, cycleLength };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>广义鸽巢原理</strong>：如果 kn+1 个物体放入 n 个盒子，则至少有一个盒子包含 k+1 个或更多物体。推论：如果 m 个物体放入 n 个盒子，则至少有一个盒子包含 ⌈m/n⌉ 个物体。</p>\n<p>在负载均衡中，即使使用最优的分配策略，n 个请求分配到 k 个服务器，最繁忙的服务器至少处理 ⌈n/k⌉ 个请求。这为负载均衡器的性能提供了理论下界。</p>\n<p><strong>Ramsey 理论</strong>是鸽巢原理的深刻推广。Ramsey 定理说：在足够大的结构中，秩序是不可避免的。经典结论：在任意 6 个人中，必然存在 3 个人互相认识或 3 个人互不认识。这对应 R(3,3) = 6。</p>\n<p><strong>编程中的鸽巢应用</strong>：如果一个函数的返回值域是有限集合（如 32 位整数），那么在超过 2³² 次调用后，必然有两次返回相同的值。这在分析伪随机数生成器的周期时很重要——32 位 PRNG 的周期不可能超过 2³²。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容斥原理\">容斥原理</h2><p><strong>容斥原理</strong>（Inclusion-Exclusion Principle）精确计算多个集合并集的大小。</p>\n<p>两集合：|A ∪ B| = |A| + |B| - |A ∩ B|</p>\n<p>三集合：|A ∪ B ∪ C| = |A| + |B| + |C| - |A ∩ B| - |A ∩ C| - |B ∩ C| + |A ∩ B ∩ C|</p>\n<p>一般公式：|A₁ ∪ ... ∪ Aₙ| = ∑|Aᵢ| - ∑|Aᵢ ∩ Aⱼ| + ∑|Aᵢ ∩ Aⱼ ∩ Aₖ| - ... + (-1)ⁿ⁺¹|A₁ ∩ ... ∩ Aₙ|</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 两集合容斥&#10;        A((A))&#10;        B((B))&#10;        C[&quot;A∩B 被减一次&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    D[&quot;|A∪B| = |A| + |B| - |A∩B|&quot;]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 两集合容斥\n        A((A))\n        B((B))\n        C[\"A∩B 被减一次\"]\n    end\n    D[\"|A∪B| = |A| + |B| - |A∩B|\"]</pre><p>容斥原理的直觉：简单地把各集合大小相加会多算交集部分。两两交集被多算了一次，减去后三三交集又被多减了一次，加回来后......交替加减直到精确。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function inclusionExclusion(sets: Set&lt;number&gt;[], universe: number): number {&#10;  const n = sets.length;&#10;  let result = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let mask = 1; mask &lt; 1 &lt;&lt; n; mask++) {&#10;    let intersection = new Set(Array.from({ length: universe }, (_, i) =&gt; i));&#10;    let bitsCount = 0;&#10;&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;      if (mask &amp; (1 &lt;&lt; i)) {&#10;        bitsCount++;&#10;        intersection = new Set([...intersection].filter((x) =&gt; sets[i].has(x)));&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (bitsCount % 2 === 1) result += intersection.size;&#10;    else result -= intersection.size;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inclusionExclusion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">universe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sets.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; mask</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intersection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: universe }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bitsCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        bitsCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        intersection </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intersection].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sets[i].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (bitsCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intersection.size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intersection.size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"容斥原理的经典应用\">容斥原理的经典应用</h2><p><strong>错排问题</strong>（Derangement）：n 个元素的排列中，没有任何元素在原来位置上的排列有多少种？</p>\n<p>设 Aᵢ 为&quot;第 i 个元素在原位&quot;的排列集合，则错排数 = n! - |A₁ ∪ A₂ ∪ ... ∪ Aₙ|。</p>\n<p>由容斥原理：Dₙ = n! × (1 - 1/1! + 1/2! - 1/3! + ... + (-1)ⁿ/n!)</p>\n<p>当 n 很大时，Dₙ/n! → 1/e ≈ 0.3679。这意味着随机排列恰好是错排的概率约为 36.8%——这个比例不依赖于 n，是一个令人惊讶的结果。</p>\n<p><strong>满射计数</strong>：从 n 元素集合到 m 元素集合的满射函数有多少个？设 Aᵢ 为&quot;不映射到第 i 个元素&quot;的函数集合。满射数 = mⁿ - |A₁ ∪ ... ∪ Aₘ|。</p>\n<p>由容斥原理：S(n, m) = ∑ (-1)ⁱ × C(m, i) × (m-i)ⁿ</p>\n<p><strong>欧拉函数</strong> φ(n) 计算 1 到 n 中与 n 互素的整数个数。利用容斥原理：φ(n) = n × ∏(1 - 1/p)，其中 p 遍历 n 的所有素因子。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>容斥对象</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错排数 Dₙ</td>\n<td>元素在原位的排列</td>\n<td>n! × ∑(-1)ᵏ/k!</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>满射数</td>\n<td>未被映射到的元素</td>\n<td>∑(-1)ⁱ C(m,i)(m-i)ⁿ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧拉函数 φ(n)</td>\n<td>与 n 有公因子的数</td>\n<td>n × ∏(1-1/p)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合覆盖</td>\n<td>未被覆盖的元素</td>\n<td>容斥各子集覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工程中的应用\">工程中的应用</h2><p><strong>布隆过滤器的误判率</strong>：布隆过滤器使用 k 个哈希函数将元素映射到 m 位的位数组。插入 n 个元素后，某一位仍为 0 的概率为 (1 - 1/m)^(kn) ≈ e^(-kn/m)。误判率（查询不存在的元素报告存在）为 (1 - e^(-kn/m))^k。这个分析本质上使用了补集计数和独立概率的乘法原理。</p>\n<p><strong>数据库去重</strong>：在进行多条件查询时，&quot;满足条件 A 或条件 B&quot;的结果数需要用容斥原理计算。SQL 的 UNION 操作自动去重，其底层逻辑就是容斥——先合并两个结果集，再去掉重复行。</p>\n<p><strong>网络安全的最坏情况分析</strong>：使用鸽巢原理可以证明，对于 2⁶⁴ 空间的哈希函数，只需约 2³² 个样本就有约 50% 的概率找到碰撞。这是生日攻击（Birthday Attack）的数学基础，也是为什么密码学哈希函数需要至少 256 位输出。</p>\n<p><strong>A/B 测试中的容斥</strong>：当测试多个实验的联合效果时，不能简单相加各实验的提升幅度。如果实验 A 提升 5%，实验 B 提升 3%，两者的联合提升不一定是 8%——需要考虑交叉效应（对应集合的交集），这正是容斥原理在实验分析中的体现。</p>\n<p><strong>图着色问题的色多项式</strong>可以通过容斥原理推导。设 Aᵢ 为&quot;边 eᵢ 的两个端点同色&quot;的着色集合，则合法着色数 = 总着色数 - |A₁ ∪ A₂ ∪ ... ∪ Aₘ|。容斥展开后就得到了色多项式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function derangementCount(n: number): number {&#10;  if (n === 0) return 1;&#10;  if (n === 1) return 0;&#10;  let prev2 = 1;&#10;  let prev1 = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 2; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    const curr = (i - 1) * (prev1 + prev2);&#10;    prev2 = prev1;&#10;    prev1 = curr;&#10;  }&#10;  return prev1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> derangementCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> curr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> curr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((鸽巢与容斥))&#10;    鸽巢原理&#10;      碰撞不可避免&#10;      循环检测&#10;      负载均衡下界&#10;    容斥原理&#10;      集合并的精确计数&#10;      交替加减&#10;    经典应用&#10;      错排问题&#10;      满射计数&#10;      欧拉函数&#10;    工程应用&#10;      布隆过滤器&#10;      数据库去重&#10;      生日攻击\">mindmap\n  root((鸽巢与容斥))\n    鸽巢原理\n      碰撞不可避免\n      循环检测\n      负载均衡下界\n    容斥原理\n      集合并的精确计数\n      交替加减\n    经典应用\n      错排问题\n      满射计数\n      欧拉函数\n    工程应用\n      布隆过滤器\n      数据库去重\n      生日攻击</pre><ul>\n<li>鸽巢原理证明碰撞的必然存在，是哈希碰撞不可避免性和循环检测的理论基础</li>\n<li>广义鸽巢原理给出了最繁忙桶的下界 ⌈m/n⌉，为负载均衡提供理论参考</li>\n<li>容斥原理通过交替加减各级交集，精确计算多集合并的大小</li>\n<li>错排数 Dₙ/n! → 1/e 是一个与 n 无关的常数，展现了组合数学的优雅</li>\n<li>容斥原理在计算满射数、欧拉函数和布隆过滤器误判率中都有核心应用</li>\n<li>生日攻击利用鸽巢原理，只需 O(√N) 个样本就能以高概率找到碰撞</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"鸽巢原理与容斥原理","id":"鸽巢原理与容斥原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"鸽巢原理","id":"鸽巢原理"},{"level":2,"text":"容斥原理","id":"容斥原理"},{"level":2,"text":"容斥原理的经典应用","id":"容斥原理的经典应用"},{"level":2,"text":"工程中的应用","id":"工程中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"排列与组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/permutations-combinations"},"next":{"title":"生成函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/generating-functions"}}